WEBVTT

1
00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:04.708
Arjun has expressed his wish

2
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:07.875
to behold Lord Krishna's Viraat Vishwarupa.

3
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:10.916
Lord Krishna now fulfils his wish.

4
00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:14.750
He is about to grant Arjun
an extraordinary vision.

5
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.708
It is a revelation of His divine glories,

6
00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:21.750
manifesting in countless heavenly forms.

7
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.458
This Viraat Vishwarupa

8
00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.666
has never been seen before.

9
00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:28.250
It contains within it the entire cosmic order,

10
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:29.291
divine beings,

11
00:01:29.291 --> 00:01:32.333
and all of existence.

12
00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:37.208
Everything is contained within
Lord Krishna's divine body.

13
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.375
Lord Krishna asks Arjun

14
00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:46.833
to behold His unlimited forms.

15
00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:48.916
He repeatedly emphasises the word

16
00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:51.958
'pashya' – 'see.'

17
00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:53.083
This repetition

18
00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:54.416
highlights the uniqueness

19
00:01:54.416 --> 00:01:56.750
of this revelation.

20
00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:58.875
Arjun is about to see something

21
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:01.625
never seen before.

22
00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:04.666
Lord Krishna's Vishwarupa
manifests specifically

23
00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:08.458
to reveal His infinite power.

24
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:11.041
Lord Krishna describes this Vishwarupa

25
00:02:11.041 --> 00:02:14.333
as hundreds and thousands of divine shapes,

26
00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.250
colours, and the living presence

27
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:18.583
of their forms.

28
00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:21.000
This is not merely a single form,

29
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.333
but contains His all-pervading vision.

30
00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:26.125
Within one form,

31
00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:29.083
countless other forms are present.

32
00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:32.750
He then asks Arjun to behold the
 Adityas, the Vasus, the Rudras,

33
00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:33.875
the Ashwini Kumars,

34
00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:37.125
and other heavenly beings.

35
00:02:37.125 --> 00:02:38.000
By showing these,

36
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.500
He is revealing

37
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.791
that He is the source of all divine powers

38
00:02:41.791 --> 00:02:43.875
and their sustainer.

39
00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:48.625
Arjun is being prepared for
an overwhelming experience.

40
00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:51.416
An experience that is beyond imagination

41
00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:55.375
and far beyond the limits of human thought.

42
00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:57.416
The significance of this revelation

43
00:02:57.416 --> 00:02:59.500
lies in its purpose.

44
00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.208
The sweet and personal form of Lord Krishna,

45
00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:06.166
that Arjun so dearly loved,
completely different from that,

46
00:03:06.166 --> 00:03:08.291
this Vishwarupa is a display

47
00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:10.375
of pure power and grandeur.

48
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:11.458
Its purpose

49
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:15.500
is to show Arjun, and ultimately the entire world,

50
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.916
that Lord Krishna alone is the supreme being,

51
00:03:18.916 --> 00:03:22.791
beyond all assumptions and human limitations.

52
00:03:22.791 --> 00:03:26.083
Interestingly, a glimpse of this power

53
00:03:26.083 --> 00:03:29.000
was once shown to Duryodhan,

54
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.125
when he tried to bind

55
00:03:30.125 --> 00:03:32.333
Lord Krishna.

56
00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:35.666
But Duryodhan, dismissing it as a magical trick,

57
00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:38.750
did not believe in it.

58
00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.083
Arjun, however, engages with this vision

59
00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:44.541
with complete devotion and surrender,

60
00:03:44.541 --> 00:03:46.166
which makes him worthy to behold

61
00:03:46.166 --> 00:03:49.291
this Viraat Vishwarupa.

62
00:03:49.291 --> 00:03:51.291
Lord Krishna further emphasises

63
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:54.083
that whatever Arjun wishes to see,

64
00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:56.583
past, present, and future,

65
00:03:56.583 --> 00:03:59.833
all of it is present within His divine form.

66
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:02.208
This means that Arjun is seeing not just

67
00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:04.750
the vastness of the universe,

68
00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.208
but also the destiny

69
00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:08.250
of all things,

70
00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:11.541
including the outcome of the war.

71
00:04:11.541 --> 00:04:13.916
This vision is far deeper.

72
00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:15.416
Beyond the understanding

73
00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:18.958
of even the greatest scientist or mystic.

74
00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:20.000
No person

75
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.625
can see the entire universe

76
00:04:21.625 --> 00:04:24.083
from one place.

77
00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:25.583
Yet Lord Krishna

78
00:04:25.583 --> 00:04:29.333
enables Arjun to see it with ease.

79
00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:32.458
Yet this vision is not for intellectual analysis

80
00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:34.625
or mere curiosity.

81
00:04:34.625 --> 00:04:37.375
It is to strengthen Arjun's faith

82
00:04:37.375 --> 00:04:40.041
and, about Lord Krishna's supremacy,

83
00:04:40.041 --> 00:04:44.541
to remove any remaining doubt.

84
00:04:44.541 --> 00:04:47.583
It is also a warning for the future.

85
00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:50.583
Many false claimants may arise,

86
00:04:50.583 --> 00:04:53.208
but only the true Supreme Lord.

87
00:04:53.208 --> 00:04:57.416
Such a divine, all-pervading form can manifest.

88
00:04:57.416 --> 00:04:59.166
No one else can.

89
00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:06.208
Your desires

90
00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:08.416
shape what you see

91
00:05:08.416 --> 00:05:12.208
and experience in your life.

92
00:05:12.208 --> 00:05:15.041
They give it shape.

93
00:05:15.041 --> 00:05:17.500
I did not show Arjun My

94
00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:21.416
Vishwarupa

95
00:05:21.416 --> 00:05:25.125
until he expressed

96
00:05:25.125 --> 00:05:28.125
his wish to see it.

97
00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:30.958
This reveals that

98
00:05:30.958 --> 00:05:34.250
what you pay attention to,

99
00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:39.083
what you deeply desire,

100
00:05:39.083 --> 00:05:41.666
begins to shape

101
00:05:41.666 --> 00:05:45.041
your reality.

102
00:05:45.041 --> 00:05:46.708
Desire

103
00:05:46.708 --> 00:05:50.333
works like a lens.

104
00:05:50.333 --> 00:05:54.083
What you want to see,

105
00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:56.583
that is what you begin to see.

106
00:05:56.583 --> 00:05:59.625
Suppose you need to go to a new office,

107
00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:02.708
temple, or school.

108
00:06:02.708 --> 00:06:05.500
Then what must you do?

109
00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:08.375
You must find its address.

110
00:06:08.375 --> 00:06:10.458
While making the effort for this,

111
00:06:10.458 --> 00:06:15.458
you must humbly ask the knowledgeable
people of that area

112
00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:19.416
for the right way.

113
00:06:19.416 --> 00:06:20.875
This desire,

114
00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:24.708
and the right effort made for it,

115
00:06:24.708 --> 00:06:27.916
is what takes you to the right address.

116
00:06:27.916 --> 00:06:32.875
However, desire alone is not enough.

117
00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:34.375
It must be combined

118
00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:39.833
with the right approach.

119
00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:41.541
Arjun

120
00:06:41.541 --> 00:06:43.583
came to Me with humility

121
00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:47.583
and respect.

122
00:06:47.583 --> 00:06:50.250
He did not demand proof,

123
00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:54.208
but asked sincerely.

124
00:06:54.208 --> 00:06:57.458
Because of his humble approach,

125
00:06:57.458 --> 00:07:00.208
I showed him what

126
00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:02.375
very few people

127
00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:04.625
have ever seen.

128
00:07:04.625 --> 00:07:06.083
In the same way,

129
00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:09.750
when you desire something in life,

130
00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:13.666
desire it with the right mindset,

131
00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.833
whether it is success,

132
00:07:15.833 --> 00:07:19.333
knowledge, or personal growth.

133
00:07:19.333 --> 00:07:22.583
For this, always remain humble,

134
00:07:22.583 --> 00:07:24.500
be patient,

135
00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.958
and stay committed to your goal.

136
00:07:27.958 --> 00:07:30.041
When your desires

137
00:07:30.041 --> 00:07:33.916
are paired with the right approach,

138
00:07:33.916 --> 00:07:36.291
then doors open.

139
00:07:36.291 --> 00:07:40.083
You begin to see opportunities,

140
00:07:40.083 --> 00:07:43.041
gain insight,

141
00:07:43.041 --> 00:07:47.833
and draw closer to fulfilment.

142
00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:50.958
Sincere desire leads you

143
00:07:50.958 --> 00:07:55.916
to experiences that once seemed impossible.

144
00:08:00.708 --> 00:08:02.500
In families,

145
00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.083
elders hold valuable

146
00:08:05.083 --> 00:08:08.250
experience and knowledge.

147
00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.500
But how much you benefit from it

148
00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:16.166
depends on your approach.

149
00:08:16.166 --> 00:08:18.041
Just as Arjun

150
00:08:18.041 --> 00:08:22.166
approached Me with humility

151
00:08:22.166 --> 00:08:24.291
and received not only

152
00:08:24.291 --> 00:08:27.875
the vision of My Vishwarupa,

153
00:08:27.875 --> 00:08:29.208
but also

154
00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:33.375
insight into the future,

155
00:08:33.375 --> 00:08:37.916
in the same way, approaching
elders with respect

156
00:08:37.916 --> 00:08:41.333
and sincerity

157
00:08:41.333 --> 00:08:44.875
opens the door to their guidance.

158
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:46.291
At the office,

159
00:08:46.291 --> 00:08:49.291
in business, in education, when any

160
00:08:49.291 --> 00:08:52.916
obstacle arises, seeking advice
from experienced

161
00:08:52.916 --> 00:08:57.083
elders in the family without ego

162
00:08:57.083 --> 00:09:00.833
always suggests the right solution.

163
00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:04.625
They will show you the way with affection.

164
00:09:04.625 --> 00:09:07.500
They will not mock you,

165
00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.791
because you are dear to them.

166
00:09:10.791 --> 00:09:13.416
If you go with arrogance

167
00:09:13.416 --> 00:09:17.833
or a feeling of dismissiveness,

168
00:09:17.833 --> 00:09:23.041
then their wisdom may remain
beyond your reach.

169
00:09:23.041 --> 00:09:24.583
But when

170
00:09:24.583 --> 00:09:29.458
you accept their advice with an open heart,

171
00:09:29.458 --> 00:09:32.875
then they share such lessons

172
00:09:32.875 --> 00:09:36.666
that can help you face present challenges

173
00:09:36.666 --> 00:09:41.083
and prepare for the future.

174
00:09:41.083 --> 00:09:43.666
Their life experiences are often

175
00:09:43.666 --> 00:09:47.500
also about situations that

176
00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:52.958
you have not yet encountered.

177
00:09:52.958 --> 00:09:55.250
Think of their guidance

178
00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.958
as a map.

179
00:09:57.958 --> 00:10:01.458
They have already walked those paths

180
00:10:01.458 --> 00:10:05.875
that you are only just beginning to explore.

181
00:10:05.875 --> 00:10:08.541
By listening with the right approach,

182
00:10:08.541 --> 00:10:11.000
you avoid mistakes

183
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.791
and gain clarity.

184
00:10:12.791 --> 00:10:16.541
Just as Arjun's desire and humility

185
00:10:16.541 --> 00:10:18.333
earned him a

186
00:10:18.333 --> 00:10:20.916
rare vision,

187
00:10:20.916 --> 00:10:23.833
in the same way, your respect

188
00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:26.166
and eagerness to learn

189
00:10:26.166 --> 00:10:29.041
open the door to that knowledge

190
00:10:29.041 --> 00:10:32.541
which, for you and your family,

191
00:10:32.541 --> 00:10:36.791
can shape a better future.

192
00:10:41.625 --> 00:10:44.666
As a leader,

193
00:10:44.666 --> 00:10:48.250
to teach your colleagues something,

194
00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.458
how do you use

195
00:10:50.458 --> 00:10:53.083
your experience?

196
00:10:53.083 --> 00:10:56.583
By speaking harshly to them
about their shortcomings,

197
00:10:56.583 --> 00:11:01.583
or by encouraging them with an open heart?

198
00:11:01.583 --> 00:11:04.083
In professional life,

199
00:11:04.083 --> 00:11:06.750
responsible leadership means

200
00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:09.875
guiding people not only through

201
00:11:09.875 --> 00:11:12.583
their current tasks,

202
00:11:12.583 --> 00:11:13.791
but also

203
00:11:13.791 --> 00:11:16.958
preparing them for future challenges.

204
00:11:16.958 --> 00:11:18.750
When I showed Arjun

205
00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:22.291
the Viraat Rupa,

206
00:11:22.291 --> 00:11:24.000
I did not show him only

207
00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.291
the present situation,

208
00:11:27.291 --> 00:11:29.125
but also prepared him for

209
00:11:29.125 --> 00:11:31.708
the challenges of the future.

210
00:11:31.708 --> 00:11:33.500
In the same way,

211
00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:38.916
good leadership too must do two things.

212
00:11:38.916 --> 00:11:41.708
Give support for immediate problems

213
00:11:41.708 --> 00:11:43.708
and provide the right

214
00:11:43.708 --> 00:11:45.791
fulfilment for the long term.

215
00:11:45.791 --> 00:11:47.333
Your team may focus

216
00:11:47.333 --> 00:11:49.708
on current goals,

217
00:11:49.708 --> 00:11:52.250
but it is your responsibility

218
00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:58.333
to help them see beyond their present.

219
00:11:58.333 --> 00:12:00.125
Give them the skills,

220
00:12:00.125 --> 00:12:02.541
knowledge, and mindset

221
00:12:02.541 --> 00:12:06.333
they need to grow, to prepare themselves,

222
00:12:06.333 --> 00:12:10.041
and to succeed in the future.

223
00:12:10.041 --> 00:12:11.083
This means not

224
00:12:11.083 --> 00:12:13.458
only solving today's problems,

225
00:12:13.458 --> 00:12:16.708
but also anticipating

226
00:12:16.708 --> 00:12:18.958
what is going to happen ahead,

227
00:12:18.958 --> 00:12:21.083
what is coming next.

228
00:12:21.083 --> 00:12:25.958
When you lead with this dual focus,

229
00:12:25.958 --> 00:12:28.416
then you bring trust

230
00:12:28.416 --> 00:12:31.166
and a humility for learning to your team.

231
00:12:31.166 --> 00:12:32.875
They learn to trust

232
00:12:32.875 --> 00:12:36.666
your guidance, knowing

233
00:12:36.666 --> 00:12:42.291
that you have their long-term growth in mind.

234
00:12:42.291 --> 00:12:45.583
Like Arjun, they find clarity

235
00:12:45.583 --> 00:12:47.291
and strength,

236
00:12:47.291 --> 00:12:50.125
not just for today's challenges,

237
00:12:50.125 --> 00:12:55.291
but also for those obstacles that are yet to come.
